title: "NLE-Predictor: Automated Non-Linear Effect Predictors and Thermodynamic Intelligence for Asymmetric Catalysis"
abstract: "Quantitative prediction of non-linear effects (NLE) in asymmetric catalysis couples quantum chemical conformational sampling (CREST/xTB) and DFT with analytical Jacobian mass-balance solvers, active dimer kinetics, and non-linear regression."
